        },
        {
          "text": "Alimwi Solomoni wakatumina Huramu mwami wa-Turo, wati, Mbubonya mbowakacitila Davida taata, mbowakamutumina zisamu zyakuliyakila Iŋanda yakukala, kondicitila ambebo mbubonya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
