        {
          "text": "Bona! Ndaamba kuyaka iŋanda yazina lya-Jehova Leza wangu, kuti nkamusalazizye njiyo, ibe yakutenta tununkilizyo kubusyu bwakwe, tununkilizyo twa misamu mibotu, azinkwa zituulidwe lyoonse, azipaizyo zyacifumo azyamangolezya, mumazuba aa-Sabata amumazuba aamwezi mupiya amumapobwe aabambidwe aaJehova Leza wesu, mbukulaililwa lyoonse mucisi ca-Israyeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
