        },
        {
          "text": "Lino konditumina muntu uucenjede uubwene milimo yangolida ayansiliva ayamukuba ayabutale, amilimo yamasani mabotu aasalala na aasalala pyu na aasia-sia, uuzi kulemba zilembyo zyeebesi, kuti abe abasimilimo bacenjede mbenjisi mucisi ca-Juda amuJerusalemu, mbaakabika Davida taata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
