        },
        {
          "text": "Alimwi konditumina zisamu zyakedari azyamulombe azyaalgumi kuzwa ku-Lebano, nkaambo ndizi kuti balanda bako balibwene kutema zisamu ku-Lebano. Abalo balanda bangu bayoogwasya balanda bako, ",
