        {
          "text": "Alimwi Huramu wakati, Alumbwe Jehova Leza wa-Israyeli, iwakalenga ijulu anyika, nkaambo wapa mwami Davida mwana uucenjede uuli amaanu abusongo, uuti yakile Jehova iŋanda akuliyakila iŋanda yabwami. ",
          "type": "text",
