        },
        {
          "text": "ngumwana wamwanakazi wa-Dani, pele wisi kali muntu waku-Turo. Ulibwene kucita milimo yangolida ayansiliva ayamukuba ayabutale, amilimo yamabwe ayazisamu, amilimo yamasani aamabala mabala, aasalala nanka aasia, amasani aatuba. Alimwi ulibwene kufula malembo azifwanikisyo, kufumbwa ncoyanda, Agwasyanye abasimilimo bako abasimilimo bamwami Dwida uso. ",
          "type": "text",
